# Keep one human-readable report, one executable recipe, and only the compact
# machine records needed to prove the final archive. All intermediate audits,
# timings, path listings, request logs, and command output stay local and are
# regenerated by commands.sh.
*
!.gitignore
!REPORT.md
!commands.sh
!pngr-build.json
!pngr-validation.json
!public-origin-check.json
!xa7-browser-workload.json
!xa7-reader-evidence.json
!xa7-source-verification.json
!accession-gbwt-build.default-buffer.aborted.json

# One compact cross-browser summary; its workload is retained above. Raw
# queries, environment captures, per-request logs, and public-reader reruns are
# described in REPORT.md and remain reproducible local evidence.
!browser/
browser/*
!browser/xa7-browser/
browser/xa7-browser/*
!browser/xa7-browser/summary.json
